<section class="wiki-page-hero"><div class="container"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><a data-copy-en="Player Wiki" data-copy-zh="玩家 Wiki" href="../wiki.html">Player Wiki</a><span>/</span><span data-copy-en="Syndicate Story and Alliance" data-copy-zh="辛迪加剧情与联盟">Syndicate Story and Alliance</span></nav>
<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Game systems" data-copy-zh="游戏系统">Game systems</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Syndicate Story and Alliance" data-copy-zh="辛迪加剧情与联盟">Syndicate Story and Alliance</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Navigate the Syndicate, follow its shared missions and alliance, and keep optional personal routes separate." data-copy-zh="找到辛迪加内部地点，依次推进共同任务与联盟支线，再按需查看个人路线。">Navigate the Syndicate, follow its shared missions and alliance, and keep optional personal routes separate.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-start">Your first circuit</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-locations">Locations and portraits</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-introductions">Eight introductions</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-missions">Shared mission route</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-alliance">Syndicate Alliance side quest</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-preparation">Affection and Rogue preparation</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-personal">Optional personal routes</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-interactions">H2Hs and other portrait actions</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-after-story">A visit after the main story</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Common blockers</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-start">先走一圈</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-locations">地点与角色头像</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-introductions">八场登场事件</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-missions">共同任务路线</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-alliance">辛迪加联盟支线</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-preparation">关系与盗贼属性准备</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-personal">可选个人剧情</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-interactions">谈心与其他头像行动</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-after-story">主线通关后的来访</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><p class="starter-reading-note" data-copy-en="Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress." data-copy-zh="点击截图可放大查看。图中的库存和进度仅为示例，请以自己的实际情况为准。">Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress.</p><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><div class="starter-lead"><p>Start at <strong>Future → Prime Sector map → Syndicate Gates</strong>. Follow the shared missions, then choose personal routes or the alliance side quest. This guide lists destinations, order and unlocks without retelling scene outcomes. It covers the complete released <strong>v1.0 Beta x</strong>.</p></div>
<section id="en-start"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Accuracy_Notes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting_and_Completion_Checklist"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_H2Hs_and_Other_Interactions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Close_Friend_Milestones"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Friend_Milestones"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Character_Story_Routes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Den_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Affection_and_Rogue_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Introductions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Getting_Started"></span><h2>Your first circuit</h2><p>The Syndicate is built into the game. Shared story events normally start <strong>automatically on entering their exact location</strong> once their conditions are met. Finish the scene, leave and re-enter to check another. Opening a portrait is not the same as completing its introduction plot.</p><p>A convenient first circuit is <strong>Gates → Den → Parlor → Motley’s Lair → Parlor → Big Top → Fortune Teller’s Booth → Gates → Funhouse → Gates → Garden → Gates</strong>. Re-enter the Gates for The Gatekeeper if a different scene took priority.</p><p>Check Communications for your current objective. The shared route does not require everyone’s romance route. Its main extra gates are <strong>07:00–17:00 for Taming the Rookie</strong> and later <strong>core Rogue 50 / 55</strong>. The alliance separately requires Story Beat 85.</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Enter Syndicate Gates from the Future Prime Sector map. Later steps take place in specific rooms inside." href="../assets/images/wiki/syndicate-guide/en-prime-sector.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Enter Syndicate Gates from the Future Prime Sector map. Later steps take place in specific rooms inside." decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/syndicate-guide/en-prime-sector.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>Enter Syndicate Gates from the Future Prime Sector map. Later steps take place in specific rooms inside.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-locations"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Locations_and_Crew"></span><h2>Locations and portraits</h2><p>Travel between the eight Syndicate locations costs zero in-game minutes. Talk, training, dates and H2Hs retain their own costs. Portrait schedules affect portrait interactions; they do not add an unlisted hour gate to shared automatic plots.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Direct connections</th><th scope="col">Portrait / activity</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Syndicate Gates</th><td data-label="Direct connections">Big Top, Den, Booth, Funhouse, Garden</td><td data-label="Portrait / activity">Bayne · all day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Big Top</th><td data-label="Direct connections">Gates, Parlor, Funhouse, Booth</td><td data-label="Portrait / activity">Kitty · all day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Den</th><td data-label="Direct connections">Gates, Parlor</td><td data-label="Portrait / activity">Timed automatic scenes</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fortune Teller’s Booth</th><td data-label="Direct connections">Gates, Big Top</td><td data-label="Portrait / activity">Zodiac · all day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Funhouse</th><td data-label="Direct connections">Gates, Big Top</td><td data-label="Portrait / activity">Chamel 00–09 / 15–24; Chamella 09–15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Garden</th><td data-label="Direct connections">Gates</td><td data-label="Portrait / activity">Poison · all day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Parlor</th><td data-label="Direct connections">Den, Big Top, Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="Portrait / activity">Shared missions / alliance</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley’s Lair</th><td data-label="Direct connections">Parlor</td><td data-label="Portrait / activity">Motley · all day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Windows include the start and exclude the end: the Funhouse switches to Chamella at 09:00 and back to Chamel at 15:00. Their relationship totals are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-introductions"><h2>Eight introductions</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">All requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Gates of Chaos</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">First visit; no earlier Syndicate plot required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The New Variable</th><td data-label="Destination">The Parlor</td><td data-label="All requirements">First visit; no earlier Syndicate plot required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Gatekeeper</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Gates of Chaos</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fresh Meat</th><td data-label="Destination">The Big Top</td><td data-label="All requirements">First visit; no earlier Syndicate plot required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Send in the Clown</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">The New Variable</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Foretold Meeting</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">First visit; no earlier Syndicate plot required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Street Knowledge</th><td data-label="Destination">The Garden</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Gates of Chaos</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Welcome to the Circus</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">First visit; no earlier Syndicate plot required</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-missions"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Missions_Part_Three"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Missions_Part_Two"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Missions_Part_One"></span><h2>Shared mission route</h2><details><summary>Part one: show all destinations and prerequisites</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">All requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Collecting Dues</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Foretold Meeting；Fresh Meat；Send in the Clown；The Gatekeeper</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Collecting Dues - The Bar</th><td data-label="Destination">Robot Bar</td><td data-label="All requirements">Collecting Dues</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cat's Eyes</th><td data-label="Destination">The Big Top</td><td data-label="All requirements">Collecting Dues - The Bar</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">New Blood</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">Collecting Dues - The Bar</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Faces</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">Collecting Dues - The Bar</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Taming the Rookie</th><td data-label="Destination">Prime Transportation Nexus Hub</td><td data-label="All requirements">New Blood；07:00–17:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Boss Takes Notice</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">Taming the Rookie；Welcome to the Circus</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lines on the Board</th><td data-label="Destination">The Parlor</td><td data-label="All requirements">Cat's Eyes；Street Knowledge；The Boss Takes Notice</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>After Collecting Dues - The Bar, complete Cat’s Eyes, New Blood and Faces. New Blood leads through Taming the Rookie to The Boss Takes Notice. Lines on the Board needs Cat’s Eyes + Street Knowledge + The Boss Takes Notice. Faces is required later, so finish it on the same circuit.</p><p><strong>Taming the Rookie uses Prime Transportation Nexus Hub</strong>, outside the circus, at 07:00–16:59. Cat’s Eyes and Taming the Rookie each grant a one-time <strong>+1 permanent Rogue</strong>.</p><details><summary>Part two: show the operation route</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">All requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Open Doors</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">Lines on the Board；Core Rogue 50+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Invisible</th><td data-label="Destination">Synergy Corp Corporate Tower</td><td data-label="All requirements">Open Doors</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Honeypot</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">Invisible；Core Rogue 55+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Plan Survives</th><td data-label="Destination">The Parlor</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Honeypot；Faces</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Abandoned Room</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">No Plan Survives</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Bug</th><td data-label="Destination">Synergy Corp Corporate Tower</td><td data-label="All requirements">No Plan Survives</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Performance</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Abandoned Room；The Bug</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Punchline</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Performance</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Both Rogue gates check the <strong>core value before equipment bonuses</strong>. After No Plan Survives, finish The Abandoned Room at the Funhouse and The Bug at Synergy Corp Corporate Tower. Return to the Funhouse for The Performance, then re-enter for The Punchline. Chamella’s daytime portrait shift is not an extra gate for these shared plots.</p><details><summary>Part three: show the last four shared steps</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">All requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Weight of a Secret</th><td data-label="Destination">The Parlor</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Punchline</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Badge and Bluster</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Weight of a Secret</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Second Knock</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Weight of a Secret；Badge and Bluster</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">After the Line</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Second Knock</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>After The Weight of a Secret, the Gates host three successive events: re-enter after each. After the Line completes this shared sequence; personal routes and the alliance are separate progress. Main Story Beat 76 needs The Bug, not completion of the alliance.</p></section>
<section id="en-alliance"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="What_the_Alliance_Unlocks"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Alliance_Affection_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Alliance_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Starting_the_Alliance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Syndicate_Alliance_Side_Quest"></span><h2>Syndicate Alliance side quest</h2><p>Complete <strong>both Story Beat 85 and After the Line</strong>, then enter the <strong>Resistance Fortress Operations Center</strong> for Room for Reinforcements. Communications shows the alliance’s next destination until all seven events are complete. This side quest does not advance the numbered story cursor.</p><details><summary>Show the seven-event alliance route</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">All requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Room for Reinforcements</th><td data-label="Destination">Operations Center — Resistance Fortress</td><td data-label="All requirements">Story Beat 85；After the Line</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Not for Free</th><td data-label="Destination">The Parlor</td><td data-label="All requirements">Room for Reinforcements</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Third Knock</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">Not for Free</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Long Way Out</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Third Knock</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Terms of Command</th><td data-label="Destination">The Parlor</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Long Way Out</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What She Built</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">Terms of Command</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Our War</th><td data-label="Destination">The Parlor</td><td data-label="All requirements">What She Built</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>There are no additional affection-stage or hour gates on these seven events. Caring, Funny and Flirty choices all lead onward, with different dialogue and relationship rewards. Motley’s The Truth changes a passage in What She Built; <strong>it is not an alliance prerequisite</strong>.</p><details><summary>Show base alliance relationship rewards and choice rewards</summary><p>These are reward inputs, not guaranteed final point totals. Normal relationship bonuses and randomized ranges can alter the actual awards.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Completion base</th><th scope="col">Choice reward base</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Room for Reinforcements</th><td data-label="Completion base">Ghost +5, AIMy +3, Kitty +3</td><td data-label="Choice reward base">Caring: Ghost +3 / Funny: AIMy +3 / Flirty: Ghost +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Not for Free</th><td data-label="Completion base">Motley +7, Zodiac +3</td><td data-label="Choice reward base">Caring: Motley +3, Zodiac +1 / Funny: Zodiac +2, Motley +2 / Flirty: Motley +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Third Knock</th><td data-label="Completion base">Motley +6, Bayne +4, Poison +4, Kitty +2</td><td data-label="Choice reward base">Caring: Motley +3, Bayne +2 / Funny: Poison +3 / Flirty: Motley +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Long Way Out</th><td data-label="Completion base">Motley +5, Zodiac +4, Chamel +5, Kitty +3, Poison +3, Bayne +2</td><td data-label="Choice reward base">Caring: Chamel +3 / Funny: Zodiac +2, Motley +1 / Flirty: Motley +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Terms of Command</th><td data-label="Completion base">Motley +7, Ghost +7</td><td data-label="Choice reward base">Caring: Ghost +3, Motley +3 / Funny: Motley +2, Ghost +1 / Flirty: Motley +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What She Built</th><td data-label="Completion base">Motley +10</td><td data-label="Choice reward base">Caring: Motley +3 / Funny: Motley +2 / Flirty: Motley +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Our War</th><td data-label="Completion base">Motley +10, Ghost +5, Kitty +5, Zodiac +5, Chamel +5, Poison +5, Bayne +5</td><td data-label="Choice reward base">Caring: Motley +3 / Funny: Kitty +2, Poison +2 / Flirty: Motley +2</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Completing <strong>Our War during normal play</strong> recruits six TD heroes: Motley, Kitty, Bayne, Zodiac, Chamel and Poison. Chamella is not a seventh recruit. Affection, H2Hs and EXTRAS replay do not substitute for live completion.</p><p><strong>Defend the Syndicate Gates</strong> appears at the Gates after Beat 85 and Our War. Its campaign has <strong>25 waves</strong> including the District Reclaimer; clearing it unlocks that battlefield’s Infinite Mode. Earned battle EXP survives defeat. Use <a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a> for deployment, training, equipment and supply preparation.</p><p>After the alliance, Motley offers the separate <strong>A Place to Return</strong> H2H at her Lair: Friend+, Our War complete, base <strong>60 minutes / 10 Energy</strong>. Her romantic H2H chain is not required.</p></section>
<section id="en-preparation"><h2>Affection and Rogue preparation</h2><p>Ordinary Talk requires <strong>Acquaintance with that individual: normally 50 points</strong>. It takes 15 minutes, has a 1-point base award and a safe limit of five per character per day. Going over can annoy the character and lose affection. Use introductions, shared missions and Known-stage Den scenes to build initial progress.</p><p>At Kitty Acquaintance+, select <strong>Rogue Training</strong> from her Big Top portrait. A successful lesson costs a base <strong>$150, 60 minutes and 20 Energy</strong> and grants <strong>+1 core Rogue and 3 base Kitty affection</strong>, with a safe limit of three per day. Over-limit attempts do not continue the same training reward.</p><details><summary>Show normal relationship thresholds</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Stage</th><th scope="col">Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Known</th><td data-label="Points">25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Acquaintance</th><td data-label="Points">50</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Friend</th><td data-label="Points">100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Close Friend</th><td data-label="Points">200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Crush</th><td data-label="Points">400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Romantic</th><td data-label="Points">800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate</th><td data-label="Points">1600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">In Love</th><td data-label="Points">3000</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-personal"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Later_Personal_Events"></span><h2>Optional personal routes</h2><p>These routes are separate from shared missions and alliance recruitment. Meet every listed condition. Friend scenes generally do not require the corresponding Den scene, while Close Friend scenes require their Friend predecessor. Later titles are navigation labels; their revelations are left to the game.</p><details><summary>Show six Known-stage Den scenes</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">All requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Cat's Out of the Bag</th><td data-label="Destination">The Den</td><td data-label="All requirements">Kitty: Known+；00:00–06:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Interview</th><td data-label="Destination">The Den</td><td data-label="All requirements">Motley: Known+；06:00–09:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Downtime</th><td data-label="Destination">The Den</td><td data-label="All requirements">Bayne: Known+；09:00–12:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Something Green</th><td data-label="Destination">The Den</td><td data-label="All requirements">Poison: Known+；12:00–18:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What the Cards Don't Show</th><td data-label="Destination">The Den</td><td data-label="All requirements">Zodiac: Known+；18:00–00:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reflections</th><td data-label="Destination">The Den</td><td data-label="All requirements">Chamel: Known+；18:00–00:00</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Zodiac and Chamel share 18:00–24:00. Re-enter the Den after the first to trigger the other.</p></details><details><summary>Show Friend and Close Friend milestones</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">All requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Kitten's Got Claws</th><td data-label="Destination">The Big Top</td><td data-label="All requirements">Kitty: Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dead Ends</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">Zodiac: Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Curtain Call</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">Chamel: Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Green Thumb</th><td data-label="Destination">The Garden</td><td data-label="All requirements">Poison: Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Observation</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">Motley: Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Post</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">Fresh Meat；The Foretold Meeting；Bayne: Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Ninth Life</th><td data-label="Destination">The Big Top</td><td data-label="All requirements">Kitten's Got Claws；Kitty: Close Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cards on the Table</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">Dead Ends；Zodiac: Close Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Mirror</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">Curtain Call；Chamel: Close Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Roots</th><td data-label="Destination">The Garden</td><td data-label="All requirements">Green Thumb；Poison: Close Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Tell</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Observation；Motley: Close Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Standing Watch</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Post；Bayne: Close Friend+</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Later personal route opt-in: show titles and cross-character prerequisites</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">All requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Necessary Evil</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Honeypot；Zodiac: Close Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Confession</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Necessary Evil；Zodiac: Crush+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Game</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Honeypot；The Confession</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Reckoning</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Confession；The Game；Motley: Friend+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Behind the Curtain</th><td data-label="Destination">Fortune Teller’s Booth</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Reckoning</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Summons</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Tell；Behind the Curtain；Motley: Crush+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Fascination</th><td data-label="Destination">The Den</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Summons；Motley: Crush+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Dissection</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Fascination；Motley: Romantic+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Truth</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Dissection；Motley: Romantic+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Push Back</th><td data-label="Destination">The Big Top</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Ninth Life；Kitty: Crush+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Invitation</th><td data-label="Destination">The Big Top</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Push Back；Kitty: Romantic+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tamed</th><td data-label="Destination">The Big Top</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Invitation；Kitty: Intimate+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Test</th><td data-label="Destination">The Garden</td><td data-label="All requirements">Roots；Fresh Meat；Send in the Clown；Poison: Crush+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Proving Ground</th><td data-label="Destination">The Garden</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Test；Poison: Romantic+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Real Poison</th><td data-label="Destination">The Garden</td><td data-label="All requirements">Proving Ground；Poison: Intimate+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Real Thing</th><td data-label="Destination">The Big Top</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Mirror；The Punchline；Chamel: Intimate+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Vigil</th><td data-label="Destination">Syndicate Gates</td><td data-label="All requirements">Standing Watch；Bayne: Crush+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Order</th><td data-label="Destination">Motley’s Lair</td><td data-label="All requirements">The Vigil；The Truth；Tamed；The Test；The Real Thing；Bayne: Intimate+；Motley: Romantic+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Mirror Duty</th><td data-label="Destination">The Funhouse</td><td data-label="All requirements">Faces；09:00–15:00</td></tr></tbody></table><p>For Motley, follow Zodiac’s The Necessary Evil → The Confession, then The Game → The Reckoning → Behind the Curtain. The Order needs Poison’s The Test, not The Real Poison. Chamel’s The Real Thing occurs at <strong>The Big Top</strong>, not her normal Funhouse portrait. Chamella’s Mirror Duty needs Faces and 09:00–15:00.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-interactions"><h2>H2Hs and other portrait actions</h2><details><summary>Show ten H2Hs and their base costs</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Character</th><th scope="col">H2H</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Minutes / Energy</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Chamel</th><td data-label="H2H">Clown Time</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend+</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">30 / 15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Chamel</th><td data-label="H2H">Broken Carousel</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend+</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">45 / 20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Poison</th><td data-label="H2H">Patch Job</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend+</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">60 / 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Poison</th><td data-label="H2H">No Armor</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush+</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">75 / 15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zodiac</th><td data-label="H2H">A Fair Game</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend+</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">60 / 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zodiac</th><td data-label="H2H">Closer</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush+</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">75 / 15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="H2H">No Audience</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend+</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">60 / 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="H2H">One Honest Minute</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend+; No Audience H2H</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">60 / 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="H2H">The Last Inch</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic+; One Honest Minute H2H; The Truth</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">90 / 20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="H2H">A Place to Return</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend+; Our War</td><td data-label="Minutes / Energy">60 / 10</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Select H2Hs from the portrait menu; entering a room does not complete one. Poison’s and Zodiac’s Crush H2Hs do not require their Friend H2Hs. Kitty separately offers the one-time <strong>On the Prowl</strong> date at Crush+, 18:00–22:00, from her Big Top portrait: base <strong>$80, 120 minutes and 30 Energy</strong>.</p><details><summary>Show repeatable private-action point gates</summary><p>Kitty Style, Prove Yourself, Intimate with Zodiac and Stay a While require <strong>1,000 points</strong> with their respective characters. The Garden After Dark and Intimate with Zodiac II require <strong>1,500</strong>. Each costs a base 30 minutes / 20 Energy, once per action per day. Romantic starts at 800, so that stage alone does not satisfy a 1,000-point gate.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-after-story"><h2>A visit after the main story</h2><details><summary>Post-story opt-in: show the entry requirement</summary><p>After completing Story Beat 100, enter <strong>The Den</strong> for a new one-time automatic event. This visit does not require the alliance, a personal romance route, an affection stage or a narrower hour window. It is a separate post-story visit, not Beat 101.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>Common blockers</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Problem</th><th scope="col">What to check</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">No shared event starts</th><td data-label="What to check">Check the exact room, every preceding event and whether this one-time scene is already complete; re-enter after another scene.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Open Doors / Honeypot missing</th><td data-label="What to check">Core Rogue 50 / 55, not the equipment-adjusted total.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Alliance missing</th><td data-label="What to check">Both Beat 85 and After the Line; start at Operations Center, not the Gates.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Heroes still locked</th><td data-label="What to check">Complete Our War during normal play; EXTRAS replay does not recruit.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Portrait or Talk unavailable</th><td data-label="What to check">Check Funhouse shifts and the individual’s Acquaintance gate; separate Chamel / Chamella totals.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The completion route covers 8 introductions, 20 later shared missions, 7 alliance events, 6 Den scenes, 12 Friend/Close Friend events, 19 later personal events and one post-story visit: <strong>73 one-time automatic events</strong>. H2Hs, Kitty’s date, lessons and repeatable actions are separate. Completing the shared story does not automatically complete the other routes.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Main Story Beats</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations</a></li><li><a href="character-kitty.html">Kitty</a></li><li><a href="character-harlequin.html">Motley</a></li><li><a href="character-zodiac.html">Zodiac</a></li><li><a href="character-chamel.html">Chamel</a></li><li><a href="character-chamella.html">Chamella</a></li><li><a href="character-poison.html">Poison</a></li><li><a href="character-bayne.html">Bayne</a></li></ul><p>Verified for v1.0 Beta x · Updated 8 November 2026.</p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><div class="starter-lead"><p>从<strong>未来／核心区地图 → 辛迪加大门</strong>开始。先完成共同任务，再按自己的目标推进个人路线或联盟支线。本页列出地点、顺序与解锁条件，不复述剧情结局。内容适用于完整发行版<strong>v1.0 Beta x</strong>。</p></div>
<section id="zh-start"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Accuracy_Notes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting_and_Completion_Checklist"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_H2Hs_and_Other_Interactions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Close_Friend_Milestones"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Friend_Milestones"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Character_Story_Routes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Den_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Affection_and_Rogue_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Introductions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Getting_Started"></span><h2>先走一圈</h2><p>当前辛迪加内容已内置，无需另装模组。共同剧情通常在符合条件后<strong>进入指定地点时自动开始</strong>。完成一场后，离开并重新进入，检查下一场。只打开角色头像不等于完成其登场事件。</p><p>可按这条路线完成初次拜访：<strong>大门 → 巢穴 → 会客厅 → Motley的巢穴 → 会客厅 → 大帐篷 → 占卜摊位 → 大门 → 欢乐屋 → 大门 → 花园 → 大门</strong>。若大门先触发了另一场剧情，再进出一次，补完「守门人」。</p><p>先查看通讯中的当前目标。共同任务初期不要求完成所有人的恋爱路线；主要额外门槛是「驯服菜鸟」的<strong>07:00–17:00</strong>，以及后续的<strong>基础盗贼属性50／55</strong>。联盟另有第85段主线门槛。</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：从未来核心区地图进入「辛迪加大门」。后续步骤需要到内部指定房间进行。" href="../assets/images/wiki/syndicate-guide/zh-prime-sector.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="从未来核心区地图进入「辛迪加大门」。后续步骤需要到内部指定房间进行。" decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/syndicate-guide/zh-prime-sector.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>从未来核心区地图进入「辛迪加大门」。后续步骤需要到内部指定房间进行。</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="zh-locations"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Locations_and_Crew"></span><h2>地点与角色头像</h2><p>辛迪加内部八处地点之间移动不消耗游戏时间。交谈、训练、约会和谈心仍按各自费用结算。头像出现的时段影响头像互动；共同自动剧情只有明确列出的时间条件，不需要额外套用头像排班。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">直接相连地点</th><th scope="col">常驻头像／活动</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">辛迪加大门</th><td data-label="直接相连地点">大帐篷、巢穴、占卜摊位、欢乐屋、花园</td><td data-label="常驻头像／活动">Bayne · 全天</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">大帐篷</th><td data-label="直接相连地点">大门、会客厅、欢乐屋、占卜摊位</td><td data-label="常驻头像／活动">Kitty · 全天</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">巢穴</th><td data-label="直接相连地点">大门、会客厅</td><td data-label="常驻头像／活动">按时段触发的自动剧情</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">占卜摊位</th><td data-label="直接相连地点">大门、大帐篷</td><td data-label="常驻头像／活动">Zodiac · 全天</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">欢乐屋</th><td data-label="直接相连地点">大门、大帐篷</td><td data-label="常驻头像／活动">Chamel 00–09／15–24；Chamella 09–15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">花园</th><td data-label="直接相连地点">大门</td><td data-label="常驻头像／活动">Poison · 全天</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">会客厅</th><td data-label="直接相连地点">巢穴、大帐篷、Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="常驻头像／活动">共同任务／联盟会面</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley的巢穴</th><td data-label="直接相连地点">会客厅</td><td data-label="常驻头像／活动">Motley · 全天</td></tr></tbody></table><p>时间包含起点、不包含终点：09:00切换为Chamella，15:00切回Chamel。两人的关系点数独立。</p></section>
<section id="zh-introductions"><h2>八场登场事件</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">全部前置条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">混沌之门 (The Gates of Chaos)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">首次进入；无此前辛迪加事件要求</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新变量 (The New Variable)</th><td data-label="地点">会客厅</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">首次进入；无此前辛迪加事件要求</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">守门人 (The Gatekeeper)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">混沌之门 (The Gates of Chaos)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新鲜血液 (Fresh Meat)</th><td data-label="地点">大帐篷</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">首次进入；无此前辛迪加事件要求</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">小丑登场 (Send in the Clown)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">新变量 (The New Variable)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">预言中的相遇 (The Foretold Meeting)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">首次进入；无此前辛迪加事件要求</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">街头情报 (Street Knowledge)</th><td data-label="地点">花园</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">混沌之门 (The Gates of Chaos)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">欢迎来到马戏团 (Welcome to the Circus)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">首次进入；无此前辛迪加事件要求</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-missions"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Missions_Part_Three"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Missions_Part_Two"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Missions_Part_One"></span><h2>共同任务路线</h2><details><summary>第一组：展开地点与全部条件</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">全部前置条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">收取保护费 (Collecting Dues)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">预言中的相遇 (The Foretold Meeting)；新鲜血液 (Fresh Meat)；小丑登场 (Send in the Clown)；守门人 (The Gatekeeper)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">收取保护费 - 酒吧 (Collecting Dues - The Bar)</th><td data-label="地点">机器人酒吧</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">收取保护费 (Collecting Dues)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">猫眼 (Cat's Eyes)</th><td data-label="地点">大帐篷</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">收取保护费 - 酒吧 (Collecting Dues - The Bar)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新血 (New Blood)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">收取保护费 - 酒吧 (Collecting Dues - The Bar)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">千面 (Faces)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">收取保护费 - 酒吧 (Collecting Dues - The Bar)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">驯服菜鸟 (Taming the Rookie)</th><td data-label="地点">核心区交通枢纽</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">新血 (New Blood)；07:00–17:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">老大注意到了你 (The Boss Takes Notice)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">驯服菜鸟 (Taming the Rookie)；欢迎来到马戏团 (Welcome to the Circus)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">板上的线索 (Lines on the Board)</th><td data-label="地点">会客厅</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">猫眼 (Cat's Eyes)；街头情报 (Street Knowledge)；老大注意到了你 (The Boss Takes Notice)</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>「收取保护费－酒吧」之后可分别完成「猫眼」「新血」「千面」。「新血」通向「驯服菜鸟」及「老大注意到了你」；「板上的线索」则要求「猫眼＋街头情报＋老大注意到了你」。「千面」也是后续必要条件，建议同一轮完成。</p><p>「驯服菜鸟」在马戏团之外的<strong>核心区交通枢纽</strong>触发，时间为07:00–16:59。完成「猫眼」和「驯服菜鸟」各获得一次<strong>永久盗贼属性＋1</strong>。</p><details><summary>第二组：展开侦察与行动路线</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">全部前置条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">敞开大门 (Open Doors)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">板上的线索 (Lines on the Board)；基础盗贼属性50+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">隐形 (Invisible)</th><td data-label="地点">新能集公司企业塔</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">敞开大门 (Open Doors)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">美人计 (The Honeypot)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">隐形 (Invisible)；基础盗贼属性55+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">计划终成泡影 (No Plan Survives)</th><td data-label="地点">会客厅</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">美人计 (The Honeypot)；千面 (Faces)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">废弃房间 (The Abandoned Room)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">计划终成泡影 (No Plan Survives)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">窃听器 (The Bug)</th><td data-label="地点">新能集公司企业塔</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">计划终成泡影 (No Plan Survives)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">表演 (The Performance)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">废弃房间 (The Abandoned Room)；窃听器 (The Bug)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">包袱 (The Punchline)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">表演 (The Performance)</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>两个盗贼门槛检查<strong>基础值，不计装备加成</strong>。「计划终成泡影」之后，分别在欢乐屋完成「废弃房间」、在新能集公司企业塔完成「窃听器」，再回欢乐屋完成「表演」，重新进入后完成「包袱」。这些共同事件不受Chamella头像的白天排班限制。</p><details><summary>第三组：展开共同任务最后四步</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">全部前置条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">秘密的重量 (The Weight of a Secret)</th><td data-label="地点">会客厅</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">包袱 (The Punchline)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">徽章与虚张声势 (Badge and Bluster)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">秘密的重量 (The Weight of a Secret)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第二次敲门 (The Second Knock)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">秘密的重量 (The Weight of a Secret)；徽章与虚张声势 (Badge and Bluster)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">防线之后 (After the Line)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">第二次敲门 (The Second Knock)</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>「秘密的重量」之后，大门连续承接三场剧情。每场结束后重新进入。「防线之后」完成共同任务的这一部分；它与个人路线、联盟是不同进度。主线第76段只需要推进到「窃听器」，不要求先完成联盟。</p></section>
<section id="zh-alliance"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-What_the_Alliance_Unlocks"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Alliance_Affection_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Alliance_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Starting_the_Alliance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Syndicate_Alliance_Side_Quest"></span><h2>辛迪加联盟支线</h2><p>完成<strong>主线第85段和「防线之后」</strong>，再进入<strong>反抗军堡垒的作战中心</strong>，开始「为援军留个位置」。两个条件缺一不可。通讯中的「辛迪加联盟」会提示下一处目的地；七场事件结束后，该支线提示消失。它不会替代或推进主线编号。</p><details><summary>展开联盟七步路线</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">全部前置条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">为援军留个位置 (Room for Reinforcements)</th><td data-label="地点">作战中心 · 反抗军堡垒</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">主线第85段；防线之后 (After the Line)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不是白帮忙 (Not for Free)</th><td data-label="地点">会客厅</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">为援军留个位置 (Room for Reinforcements)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第三次敲门 (The Third Knock)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">不是白帮忙 (Not for Free)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">绕远路脱身 (The Long Way Out)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">第三次敲门 (The Third Knock)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">指挥的条件 (Terms of Command)</th><td data-label="地点">会客厅</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">绕远路脱身 (The Long Way Out)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她亲手建立的 (What She Built)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">指挥的条件 (Terms of Command)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们的战争 (Our War)</th><td data-label="地点">会客厅</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">她亲手建立的 (What She Built)</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>七步路线没有额外的关系阶段或时间门槛。关心、幽默、调情三类回答都能继续推进；不同回答改变对话和关系奖励。Motley的「真相」只改变「她亲手建立的」中的一段对话，<strong>不是联盟前置条件</strong>。</p><details><summary>展开联盟关系奖励基数与选项奖励</summary><p>下表是奖励基数，不是承诺每次获得的最终点数；普通关系加成和随机范围仍可能改变实际结果。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">完成奖励基数</th><th scope="col">选项奖励基数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">为援军留个位置 (Room for Reinforcements)</th><td data-label="完成奖励基数">Ghost +5, AIMy +3, Kitty +3</td><td data-label="选项奖励基数">关心： Ghost +3 / 幽默： AIMy +3 / 调情： Ghost +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不是白帮忙 (Not for Free)</th><td data-label="完成奖励基数">Motley +7, Zodiac +3</td><td data-label="选项奖励基数">关心： Motley +3, Zodiac +1 / 幽默： Zodiac +2, Motley +2 / 调情： Motley +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第三次敲门 (The Third Knock)</th><td data-label="完成奖励基数">Motley +6, Bayne +4, Poison +4, Kitty +2</td><td data-label="选项奖励基数">关心： Motley +3, Bayne +2 / 幽默： Poison +3 / 调情： Motley +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">绕远路脱身 (The Long Way Out)</th><td data-label="完成奖励基数">Motley +5, Zodiac +4, Chamel +5, Kitty +3, Poison +3, Bayne +2</td><td data-label="选项奖励基数">关心： Chamel +3 / 幽默： Zodiac +2, Motley +1 / 调情： Motley +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">指挥的条件 (Terms of Command)</th><td data-label="完成奖励基数">Motley +7, Ghost +7</td><td data-label="选项奖励基数">关心： Ghost +3, Motley +3 / 幽默： Motley +2, Ghost +1 / 调情： Motley +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她亲手建立的 (What She Built)</th><td data-label="完成奖励基数">Motley +10</td><td data-label="选项奖励基数">关心： Motley +3 / 幽默： Motley +2 / 调情： Motley +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们的战争 (Our War)</th><td data-label="完成奖励基数">Motley +10, Ghost +5, Kitty +5, Zodiac +5, Chamel +5, Poison +5, Bayne +5</td><td data-label="选项奖励基数">关心： Motley +3 / 幽默： Kitty +2, Poison +2 / 调情： Motley +2</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>在<strong>正常游玩中完成「我们的战争」</strong>后，Motley、Kitty、Bayne、Zodiac、Chamel、Poison共六名角色加入塔防军队。Chamella没有作为第七名角色单独加入。好感、谈心和EXTRAS回放都不能代替这项完成条件。</p><p>主线第85段和「我们的战争」都完成后，辛迪加大门出现<strong>「保卫辛迪加大门」</strong>。战役共<strong>25波</strong>，包含辖区清剿者；完整通关后解锁该战场的无限模式，失败也保留已获得的战斗经验。联盟提供招募和战场入口，角色仍需按<a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">塔防指南</a>准备部署、训练、装备与补给。</p><p>联盟后，Motley在自己的巢穴提供独立谈心<strong>「能够回来的地方」</strong>：要求「朋友」以上、「我们的战争」完成，基础消耗<strong>60分钟／10精力</strong>，不要求完成她的恋爱谈心链。</p></section>
<section id="zh-preparation"><h2>关系与盗贼属性准备</h2><p>普通交谈通常要求与该角色达到<strong>「相识」：50点</strong>，每次15分钟、关系奖励基数1，每人每天安全上限5次。超出后可能出现不耐烦回应并扣除关系。先利用登场事件、共同任务和「已知」阶段的巢穴事件取得最初进度。</p><p>Kitty达到「相识」后，从大帐篷的头像选单选择<strong>「游荡者训练」（Rogue Training，提升盗贼属性）</strong>。成功课程每次基础消耗<strong>$150、60分钟、20精力</strong>，获得<strong>基础盗贼＋1、Kitty关系奖励基数3</strong>；每天安全上限3次，超出后不会继续获得相同训练收益。</p><details><summary>展开常用关系门槛</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">阶段</th><th scope="col">关系点数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">已知</th><td data-label="关系点数">25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">相识</th><td data-label="关系点数">50</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">朋友</th><td data-label="关系点数">100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密朋友</th><td data-label="关系点数">200</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">迷恋</th><td data-label="关系点数">400</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">浪漫感</th><td data-label="关系点数">800</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密</th><td data-label="关系点数">1600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">恋爱中</th><td data-label="关系点数">3000</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-personal"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Later_Personal_Events"></span><h2>可选个人剧情</h2><p>下面的路线独立于共同任务和联盟。表格中的前置条件需要全部满足；「朋友」事件通常不要求先看对应的巢穴事件，但「亲密朋友」事件需要先完成对应的「朋友」事件。后期名称只用于辨认进度，不讲述事件内容。</p><details><summary>展开六场「已知」阶段巢穴事件</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">全部前置条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">秘密已泄露 (Cat's Out of the Bag)</th><td data-label="地点">巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Kitty：已知+；00:00–06:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">访谈 (The Interview)</th><td data-label="地点">巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Motley：已知+；06:00–09:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">休息时间 (Downtime)</th><td data-label="地点">巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Bayne：已知+；09:00–12:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一片绿色 (Something Green)</th><td data-label="地点">巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Poison：已知+；12:00–18:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">牌面之外 (What the Cards Don't Show)</th><td data-label="地点">巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Zodiac：已知+；18:00–00:00</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">倒影 (Reflections)</th><td data-label="地点">巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Chamel：已知+；18:00–00:00</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Zodiac和Chamel都在18:00–24:00触发；看完一场后进出巢穴，再触发另一场。</p></details><details><summary>展开「朋友／亲密朋友」事件</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">全部前置条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">小猫也有利爪 (Kitten's Got Claws)</th><td data-label="地点">大帐篷</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Kitty：朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">死路 (Dead Ends)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Zodiac：朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">谢幕 (Curtain Call)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Chamel：朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">园艺技巧 (Green Thumb)</th><td data-label="地点">花园</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Poison：朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">观察 (The Observation)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">Motley：朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">哨位 (The Post)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">新鲜血液 (Fresh Meat)；预言中的相遇 (The Foretold Meeting)；Bayne：朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第九条命 (The Ninth Life)</th><td data-label="地点">大帐篷</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">小猫也有利爪 (Kitten's Got Claws)；Kitty：亲密朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">摊牌 (Cards on the Table)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">死路 (Dead Ends)；Zodiac：亲密朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">镜子 (The Mirror)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">谢幕 (Curtain Call)；Chamel：亲密朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">根源 (Roots)</th><td data-label="地点">花园</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">园艺技巧 (Green Thumb)；Poison：亲密朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">破绽 (The Tell)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">观察 (The Observation)；Motley：亲密朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">守夜 (Standing Watch)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">哨位 (The Post)；Bayne：亲密朋友+</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>后期个人路线：确认后展开名称与交叉前置</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">全部前置条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">必要之恶 (The Necessary Evil)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">美人计 (The Honeypot)；Zodiac：亲密朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">告白 (The Confession)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">必要之恶 (The Necessary Evil)；Zodiac：迷恋+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游戏 (The Game)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">美人计 (The Honeypot)；告白 (The Confession)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">清算 (The Reckoning)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">告白 (The Confession)；游戏 (The Game)；Motley：朋友+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">帷幕后方 (Behind the Curtain)</th><td data-label="地点">占卜摊位</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">清算 (The Reckoning)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">传唤 (The Summons)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">破绽 (The Tell)；帷幕后方 (Behind the Curtain)；Motley：迷恋+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">迷恋 (The Fascination)</th><td data-label="地点">巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">传唤 (The Summons)；Motley：迷恋+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">剖析 (The Dissection)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">迷恋 (The Fascination)；Motley：浪漫感+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">真相 (The Truth)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">剖析 (The Dissection)；Motley：浪漫感+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">顶回去 (The Push Back)</th><td data-label="地点">大帐篷</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">第九条命 (The Ninth Life)；Kitty：迷恋+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">邀请 (The Invitation)</th><td data-label="地点">大帐篷</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">顶回去 (The Push Back)；Kitty：浪漫感+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">被驯服 (Tamed)</th><td data-label="地点">大帐篷</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">邀请 (The Invitation)；Kitty：亲密+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">测试 (The Test)</th><td data-label="地点">花园</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">根源 (Roots)；新鲜血液 (Fresh Meat)；小丑登场 (Send in the Clown)；Poison：迷恋+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">训练场 (Proving Ground)</th><td data-label="地点">花园</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">测试 (The Test)；Poison：浪漫感+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">真正的 Poison (The Real Poison)</th><td data-label="地点">花园</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">训练场 (Proving Ground)；Poison：亲密+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">真实的我 (The Real Thing)</th><td data-label="地点">大帐篷</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">镜子 (The Mirror)；包袱 (The Punchline)；Chamel：亲密+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">守夜 (The Vigil)</th><td data-label="地点">辛迪加大门</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">守夜 (Standing Watch)；Bayne：迷恋+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">命令 (The Order)</th><td data-label="地点">Motley的巢穴</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">守夜 (The Vigil)；真相 (The Truth)；被驯服 (Tamed)；测试 (The Test)；真实的我 (The Real Thing)；Bayne：亲密+；Motley：浪漫感+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">镜子值勤 (Mirror Duty)</th><td data-label="地点">欢乐屋</td><td data-label="全部前置条件">千面 (Faces)；09:00–15:00</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Motley的后续路线先经过Zodiac的「必要之恶 → 告白」，再按「游戏 → 清算 → 帷幕后方」推进。「命令」要求Poison的「测试」，并不要求「真正的Poison」。Chamel的「真实的我」发生在<strong>大帐篷</strong>，而不是通常显示她头像的欢乐屋。Chamella的「镜子值勤」只要求「千面」完成及09:00–15:00。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-interactions"><h2>谈心与其他头像行动</h2><details><summary>展开十段谈心的条件与基础费用</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">角色</th><th scope="col">谈心名称</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">分钟／精力</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Chamel</th><td data-label="谈心名称">小丑时间 (Clown Time)</td><td data-label="条件">朋友以上</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">30 / 15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Chamel</th><td data-label="谈心名称">破败的旋转木马 (Broken Carousel)</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友以上</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">45 / 20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Poison</th><td data-label="谈心名称">应急包扎 (Patch Job)</td><td data-label="条件">朋友以上</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">60 / 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Poison</th><td data-label="谈心名称">无护甲 (No Armor)</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋以上</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">75 / 15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zodiac</th><td data-label="谈心名称">公平对局 (A Fair Game)</td><td data-label="条件">朋友以上</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">60 / 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zodiac</th><td data-label="谈心名称">更近一步 (Closer)</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋以上</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">75 / 15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="谈心名称">谢绝观众 (No Audience)</td><td data-label="条件">朋友以上</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">60 / 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="谈心名称">坦诚的一分钟 (One Honest Minute)</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友以上；谢绝观众谈心完成</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">60 / 10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="谈心名称">最后一寸 (The Last Inch)</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感以上；坦诚的一分钟谈心及「真相」完成</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">90 / 20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Motley</th><td data-label="谈心名称">能够回来的地方 (A Place to Return)</td><td data-label="条件">朋友以上；我们的战争完成</td><td data-label="分钟／精力">60 / 10</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>谈心从角色头像手动选择，不会因为进入地点而自动完成。Poison、Zodiac的「迷恋」谈心不要求先完成各自的「朋友」谈心。Kitty另有一次性约会<strong>「夜游」</strong>：要求「迷恋」以上、18:00–22:00，从大帐篷头像开始，基础消耗<strong>$80、120分钟、30精力</strong>。</p><details><summary>展开重复私密互动的点数门槛</summary><p>「Kitty式」、「证明你的价值。」、「与 Zodiac 亲密相处」、「多待一会儿」分别要求对应角色<strong>1,000关系点</strong>；「暗夜花园」、「与 Zodiac 亲密相处 II」要求<strong>1,500点</strong>。每项基础消耗30分钟、20精力，每项每天一次。「浪漫感」从800点开始，因此达到该阶段不等于满足1,000点门槛。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-after-story"><h2>主线通关后的来访</h2><details><summary>第100段后的可选内容：展开进入条件</summary><p>完成主线第100段后，进入<strong>巢穴</strong>可触发一次新的自动事件。本次来访不要求先完成联盟、个人恋爱路线或某个关系阶段，也没有额外时段门槛。它是独立的通关后内容，不是第101段主线。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">情况</th><th scope="col">检查项目</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">共同事件没有开始</th><td data-label="检查项目">检查准确地点、全部前置及是否已经完成；出现其他剧情后重新进入。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">「敞开大门／美人计」未出现</th><td data-label="检查项目">要求基础盗贼50／55，装备加成不能补足。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">联盟没有出现</th><td data-label="检查项目">主线第85段与「防线之后」都需完成；起点是作战中心，不是大门。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">军队角色仍未解锁</th><td data-label="检查项目">正常游玩中完成我们的战争；EXTRAS回放不招募。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">头像／交谈不可用</th><td data-label="检查项目">检查欢乐屋换班时间、该角色是否达到「相识」，以及Chamel／Chamella各自独立的点数。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>完整整理包括：8场登场、20场后续共同任务、7场联盟、6场巢穴事件、12场朋友／亲密朋友事件、19场后期个人事件，以及第100段后的1场来访，共<strong>73场一次性自动事件</strong>。谈心、Kitty约会、训练和重复互动另计。完成共同任务不等于同时完成其余路线。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线推进</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">塔防</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">地点</a></li><li><a href="character-kitty.html">Kitty</a></li><li><a href="character-harlequin.html">Motley</a></li><li><a href="character-zodiac.html">Zodiac</a></li><li><a href="character-chamel.html">Chamel</a></li><li><a href="character-chamella.html">Chamella</a></li><li><a href="character-poison.html">Poison</a></li><li><a href="character-bayne.html">Bayne</a></li></ul><p>适用于v1.0 Beta x · 2026年11月8日更新。</p></section>
